            "id": "367058e5-bc8a-4f83-8635-80831a70ea0c",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you for the kind review! We're so glad you enjoyed the house, the pool, and how close it is to the beach — and that the bikes came in handy too. As you mentioned, the door alarm is a safety feature required by the state of Florida to help protect young children around pools. We do include clear instructions in the arrival information on how to use it, and we appreciate your patience in getting used to it. We're happy to hear you had a great stay overall and would love to host you again!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "It was a nice house with a pool and had plenty of room for all of us. It was only a short walk from the beach and you could use the bikes to go further. The door had a weird alarm thing so you had to press a button but we got used to it. Overall very nice",
